ation\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n- `cargo test -p cockpit-protocol --test resource_finalization post_merge_sync_schema_v2_requires_two_pr_evidence_and_preserves_v1_boundary` (1 passed)\n- `cargo test -p cockpit-repository --lib post_merge_sync_tests::` (10 passed)\n- `cargo test -p cockpit-cli --test resource_finalization` (7 passed)\n- The hosted WI-1078 receipt is byte-identical to the original CI artifact: 462,843 bytes, SHA-256 `c8f02f60ddf10773969ef5bb6d17c0a7214e144c5d6d1c7055b2cf4f27f3df0f`; formal receipt digest `sha256:371b1a59c0b7e0f70d80dc36117840f43d341bf97bbf4f6c8284cf86a5babcbf`.\n- Candidate Runtime `1.0.1` (`sha256:56c549b02746545a7f29ebafef4158f55290bcbb3bb7db9943b0264184987587`) originally executed 14/14 nodes, spawned 14, reused 0, and all execution records exited 0. The repository package node retained `stdoutTruncated=true` and `outputTruncated=true`; stderr was not truncated.\n- Run [38252610766](https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/actions/runs/38252610766) on head `ba4350249313b2ffd95c5bae52a3ffff8e9597a9` completed successfully: route, quality, v1 behavioral oracle, and Windows Runtime jobs passed. The route included the canonical verification receipt as path 19 before gate execution.\n- Repository gate receipt reports 40/42 passed, no failures, and two `not_applicable` gates deferred until synchronized main (`docs_closed_work_item_promotion`, `docs_work_item_status_consistency`). Workspace coverage passed for all 13 planned packages with no omissions. The hosted step reused the existing fresh receipt.\n\n## Current Runtime state\n- Candidate Runtime status is `verified` and fresh, with no blockers or human decision pending. The Work Item remains `checkpointed`; `user_visible_benefit_not_declared` and validation warning `intent_alignment_missing` remain unresolved unknowns.\n- PR remains draft and unmerged. No tag or Release was created.","created_at":"2026-10-12T08:26:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T21:10:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T2